sequenceDiagram
  actor Visitor
  participant Browser
  participant Flask as Flask app.py
  participant Model as In-memory model objects
  participant Jinja as Jinja templates
  Visitor->>Browser: Enter a book title
  Browser->>Flask: POST /recommend_books
  Flask->>Flask: Trim and validate input
  alt Blank or title exceeds 200 characters
    Flask->>Jinja: Render validation feedback
    Jinja-->>Browser: HTTP 400 HTML
  else Exact title is not in pt.index
    Flask->>Jinja: Render no-match feedback
    Jinja-->>Browser: HTTP 404 HTML
  else Exact title is found
    Flask->>Model: Read matching similarity row
    Model-->>Flask: Ranked score vector
    Flask->>Model: Resolve candidate metadata
    Model-->>Flask: Title, author, cover URL
    Flask->>Jinja: Render recommendation cards
    Jinja-->>Browser: HTTP 200 HTML
  end
  Note over Flask,Model: Trusted pickle artifacts are loaded at application import
